WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.202
Small models are fast to download, use less memory, and are excellent for building the first complete version of an

00:00:08.202 --> 00:00:16.087
application. They are often strong enough for constrained extraction, classification, rewriting, or simple assistants.

00:00:16.087 --> 00:00:20.792
Start small and let evaluation tell you whether you need more.

00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:28.832
A small model that is fast, private, and accurate enough can be a better production choice than a much larger model that

00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:30.849
is only slightly more accurate.
